    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of accurately drawn plans which fail to consistently indicate the site and development parameters, lacks the necessary level of preciseness to enable officers to make a formal assessment over the potential harm caused to adjoining residents by virtue of the&amp;nbsp; proposed single storey rear extensions depth. The proposal fails to adhere to guidance contained under Para 44 of the ‘National Planning Policy Framework’ (2024) and requirements under Part 3, Article 7 of The Town and Country Planning (Development Management Procedure) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
